  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Political Economy Research to Support Inclusive Growth in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal&#x2019;s political transition to federalism presents a potential opportunity for creating a more inclusive social contract and strengthening economic development. Leaving no one behind requires a substantial broadening of political and economic opportunity and depends upon citizens having a greater political and economic stake in the country&#x2019;s future. The goal of the proposed research collaboration is to understand whether and how policy can support these objectives in the context of Nepal&#x2019;s move to a federal system.</narrative>
  </description>
